<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Softline in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Softline in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Softline Ltd said on Thursday that it was in talks that could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The firm warned shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in its shares until a further announcement is made, the firm said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003  Softline Ltd</p>
</text>
